<title>USA: North American Vaccine Q1 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>North American Vaccine Q1 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>BELTSVILLE, Md. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>							  Three Months Ended</p>
<p>								 March 31,</p>
<p>						     1997		1996</p>
<p>							----		----</p>
<p>Revenues				     $   1,075	 $     228</p>
<p>Net loss					(12,107)	   (2,515)</p>
<p>Net loss per share			    (0.38)	    (0.08)</p>
<p>Weighted-average number of common</p>
<p> shares outstanding			   31,577	    30,439</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said that without the effect of the non-cash expense related to the extension of an expiring stock option, net loss in Q1 1997 would have been $10.8 million, or $0.34 per share.</p>
<p>The company said that without the gain on the sale of an affiliate, net loss for Q1 1996 would have been $6.7 million, or $0.22 per share.</p>
<p>Full name is North American Vaccine Inc.</p>
</text>
